msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:21
msgid ""
"You can view or control the desktop environment on another computer where "
"desktop sharing is enabled. The desktop sharing works over the Remote "
"Desktop Protocol (RDP) or the Virtual Network Computing (VNC) protocol."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:23
msgid ""
"On Ubuntu, we recommend using the Remmina application to access a remote "
"desktop. It supports both RDP and VNC."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:25
msgid ""
"We'll refer to the system that shares its desktop as the *server*. We'll "
"call the system that accesses the shared desktop remotely the *client*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:27
msgid "What you'll need"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:30
msgid "A client computer running Ubuntu 24.04 LTS or later."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:31
msgid ""
"A server where RDP or VNC desktop sharing is enabled. To configure desktop "
"sharing on Ubuntu 24.04 LTS or later, see {ref}`share-your-desktop-remotely`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:32
msgid ""
"Access credentials to the server, including its host name, the port number, "
"the user name and the password."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:34
msgid "Install Remmina"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:36
msgid "Remmina is part of the extended Ubuntu installation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:38
msgid "If you don't have Remmina on your system, install it:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:0
msgid "Graphical interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:45
msgid "Search for Remmina in the App Center and install it there."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:0
msgid "Command line"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:51
msgid "Install Remmina as a Snap:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:61
msgid "Alternatively, install Remmina as Deb packages:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:72
msgid "Add a connection"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:74
msgid ""
"Click {guilabel}`Add a new connection profile` ({guilabel}`+`). The Remote "
"Desktop Preference window opens."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:76
msgid "Server credentials"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:78
msgid "Enter the server configuration:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:80
msgid "Protocol"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:81
msgid ""
"Select RDP if you're connecting to Ubuntu 24.04 LTS or later, or to "
"Microsoft Windows."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:83
msgid ""
"Select VNC if you're connecting to an earlier Ubuntu release such as 22.04 "
"LTS, or to macOS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:85
msgid "Server"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:86
msgid ""
"The host name or IP address of the server, and the port number assigned to "
"RDP or VNC. For example, `ThinkPad-X1.local:3389` or `192.168.1.2:5901`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:88
msgid "Username"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:89
msgid ""
"The user name configured for desktop sharing. Note that this might be "
"different from the actual user name on the server system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:91
msgid ""
"With VNC, the user name is only necessary if you're connecting to a server "
"that uses VNC users."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:93
msgid "Password"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:94
msgid ""
"The password configured for desktop sharing. Note that this might be "
"different from the actual user password on the server system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:96
msgid ""
"If not entered and your server requires a password, you'll be able to enter "
"it after starting the connection."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:98
msgid "Set the connection quality"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:100
msgid ""
"Optionally, you can configure the connection speed and quality in the Remote "
"Desktop Preference dialog:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:102
msgid "Colour depth"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:103
msgid ""
"Choose 24-bit for a fast connection, such as across a LAN, or 256 colors "
"when using a low bandwidth connection."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:105
msgid "Quality (on the Advanced tab)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:106
msgid ""
"Provides more control over bandwidth and rendering quality. {guilabel}`Poor` "
"trades visual quality for responsiveness, while {guilabel}`Best` does the "
"opposite."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:108
msgid "Enable audio"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:110
msgid ""
"To hear the audio from the server on your client, set {guilabel}`Audio "
"output mode` to {guilabel}`Local` on the Advanced tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:112
msgid "Confirm"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:114
msgid ""
"Click {guilabel}`Save`. Remmina now lists the newly configured connection in "
"the main window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:116
msgid "Connect to the server"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:118
msgid ""
"Double-click the configured connection. Remmina tries to connect to the "
"server."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:120
msgid ""
"You might need to accept a certificate if this is your first time connecting "
"to the server."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:122
msgid ""
"A window opens, displaying the screen on the remote server. Depending on the "
"configuration, it might be the live user session or a login screen."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:124
msgid ""
"If you can only see a fraction of the shared screen, its resolution is "
"larger than your display. Click {guilabel}`Toggle scaled mode` in the "
"toolbar on the left to resize the shared screen to fit the window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:126
msgid ""
"In toolbar, you also have options to switch to fullscreen mode, change view "
"and graphics quality."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:128
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:130
msgid "If Remmina fails to connect to the server:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:132
msgid ""
"Make sure that the server credentials are correct. Check the host name or IP "
"address, the port number, the user name and the password. Try an IP address "
"instead of a host name, or the other way around."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:134
msgid "If you have access to the server, make sure that it's running."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:136
msgid ""
"If you're trying to use the Desktop Sharing configuration, check that the "
"user is logged into the graphical session on the server."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/access-a-remote-desktop.md:138
msgid ""
"Make sure that the firewall on the server allows the RDP or VNC ports that "
"you're connecting to."
msgstr ""
